$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
(trans)-2-(3-Methyl-1,2,4-oxadiazol-5-yl)-N-((5-(3-trifluoromethoxy)
phenyl) isoqunolin-8-yl) methyl)-cyclopropanecarboxamide (V). To
(5-(3-(trifluoromethoxy) phenyl)isoquinolin-8-yl)methanamine (245 mg,
0.691 mmol) in dry DMF (10 mL) were added DIEA (0.482 mL, 2.76 mmol) and
HBTU (548 mg, 1.381 mmol). This reaction mixture was stirred for 15 min;
then, the commercially available acid (150 mg, 0.898 mmol) was added, and
the resulting mixture was stirred at room temperature overnight. Upon
completion, the reaction was concentrated in vacuo and the residue was
purified on the Gilson with a 12 min method (CH3CN/H2O 20-90%).
N-((8-(3-methoxyphenyl)isoquinolin-5-yl)methyl)-2-phenylcyclopropanecarboxamide
(10) : 78% yield. 1H NMR δ (ppm)(CH3OH-d4): 9.2 (s, 1H); 8.54 (d, J = 6
Hz, 1H); 8.10 (d, J = 6Hz, 1H); 7.83 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1H); 7.58 (d, J =
7.5Hz, 1H); 7.47 (t, J = 8Hz, 1H); 7.26(m, 3H); 7.16 (m, 3H); 7.07 (m,
3H); 4.94 (m, 2H); 3.34 (s, 3H); 2.46 (m, 1H); 1.95 (m, 1H); 1.57 (m,1H);
1.3 (m, 1H). Calculated for C27H25N2O2 [M+H]+: 409.18; found 409.2.
